Thanks Prof. Lindgren. I was wondering if I can use another effect of the type "iid" to model such a thing as follows:
formula = y ~ f(x,model=spde) + f(e,model="iid",scale=x)... i.e. put the spatial effect x as the scale of the iid effect e. But I don't know if this is possible, if so, how to do it?

Kind regards,
Michael

